  "bodyHash": "d7139f45c93acb28",
  "content": "<h3><span style=\"font-size:14pt\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span>此模组将为 Thermal Expansion 和 Fabric 模组添加 <em>IC2 钻石配方</em> 和 <em>量子护甲</em>。</span></span></span></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>当前状态：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/354786508550569994/753473835201855548/unknown.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"285\"></h2>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">支持 Fabric 的模组：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrial-revolution\" rel=\"nofollow\">Industrial Revolution</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/techreborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tech Reborn</a>。使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Items (REI)</a> 查看配方。</span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fabric 版本需要：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin</a><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge 版本需要：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kotlin for Forge</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Expansion</a>。使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a> 查看配方。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2020年9月9日之后发布的版本使用了部分 Unity 贴图：<br>Unity 贴图由 CyanideX 制作，遵循知识共享署名-非商业性使用-相同方式共享 4.0 国际许可证。</span></p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>1.11.2 &amp; 1.12.2</strong></span><br></span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span>*1.11.2 版本中 ID 已更改*</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span><span><br>配方<br></span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><del><strong><span><span>电容添加后，量子护甲的配方将会更新。</span></span></strong></del><br><br>煤球：<br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/i3Q4CdG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"320\"><br><br>压缩煤球：<br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/vNUIMP2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"373\" height=\"315\"><br><br>煤块：<br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/fqeAAng.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"322\"><br><br>钻石：<br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/W2KRreQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"376\" height=\"321\"><br><br>量子护甲：<br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/K52MRLL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"386\" height=\"511\"><br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/3YvcFNo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"389\" height=\"166\"><br><br>更多配方：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>模式压模：<br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Y8MoRyx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"311\" height=\"140\"><br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/z2dzfcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"291\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<p><br>模式存储：<br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/rWNDOIw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"289\"><br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/ZUFgvoR.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"315\" height=\"155\"><br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/KqBPS7r.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"299\" height=\"135\"><br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/gQvYOSk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"312\" height=\"410\"><br><br></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<h3><span><span><br>所需模组：</span></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/thermalexpansion/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Expansion</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><br>如何安装？</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>如果尚未安装，请先安装 Minecraft Forge；</li>\n<li>如果您已安装旧版本，请从您的 \".minecraft/mods\" 文件夹中删除任何旧版本的 IndustrialExpansion.jar 文件。</li>\n<li>如果尚未下载，请下载 ThermalExpansion.jar（适用于 1.11.2）并将其放入您的 \".minecraft/mods\" 文件夹中。</li>\n<li>下载 IndustrialExpansion.jar 文件并将其放入您的 \".minecraft/mods\" 文件夹中。</li>\n<li>重新启动/打开 Minecraft</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>1.7.10</strong></span><br></span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span>这是一个</span> <span>BETA 项目（现在“</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"> \"<span>var1</span>\" <span>已就绪，该模组很快就会有</span> \"<span>var2</span>\" <span>即机器部分</span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span><span>此模组将为 Thermal Expansion 添加 <em>IC2 钻石配方</em> 和 <em>量子护甲</em>。</span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span><span>计划中的模组</span><span> 功能：</span></span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><span><br><del>配方：64 煤炭 + 8 燧石 + 1 黑曜石 = 1 钻石</del> <strong>✓</strong> <br><del>量子护甲</del> <strong>✓</strong> <br>机器：RF 版本压缩机</span></div>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14pt\"><span>配方（直到机器更新<span><span>）：</span></span></span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>煤球：</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/FBaWdSI.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"358\" height=\"341\"></p>\n<p><br>烧过的煤球：</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/VhNB5Oo.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"336\"><br><br>煤块：</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/FmGoVXH.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"338\"></p>\n<p><br>钻石：</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/fR2KrTQ.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"339\"></p>\n<p><br>多功能工具（空）：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jn6jmRN.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"340\"><br><br>多功能工具：<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OCLOPIq.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"336\"><br><br><br>量子护甲：<br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/zWwWA73.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"244\" height=\"116\"><br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/9WLMVWN.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"124\"><br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/kky1prr.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"241\" height=\"116\"><br><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/CUz1XbS.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"243\" height=\"119\"></p>\n</div>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14pt\"><span>所需模组：</span></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/brcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BRCore 1.0+</a></span></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/thermalexpansion/files/2282512\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Expansion</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>如何安装？</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>如果尚未安装，请先安装 Minecraft Forge；</li>\n<li>如果您已安装旧版本，请从您的 \".minecraft/mods\" 文件夹中删除任何旧版本的 IndustrialExpansion.jar 文件。</li>\n<li>如果尚未下载，请下载 BRCore.jar 文件并将其放入您的 \".minecraft/mods\" 文件夹中。</li>\n<li>如果尚未下载，请下载 ThermalExpansion.jar（适用于 1.7.10）并将其放入您的 \".minecraft/mods\" 文件夹中。</li>\n<li>下载 IndustrialExpansion.jar 文件并将其放入您的 \".minecraft/mods\" 文件夹中。</li>\n<li>重新启动/打开 Minecraft</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
